<BaseLayout title="Catering & Events"><section class="section"><div class="container page"><p class="eyebrow">Catering & events</p><h1>Bring the restaurant to the gathering.</h1><p class="lede">Corporate meals, celebrations, private dining and larger group needs can be routed to the right restaurant and team. Location-specific packages and availability will be surfaced here as they are published.</p><a class="button primary" href="/locations/">Find a nearby restaurant</a></div></section></BaseLayout>
<style>.page{display:grid;gap:26px}.page .button{justify-self:start}</style>
